---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for My Sorted Nest.">
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="font-body-compact text-body-compact text-on-surface-variant mb-space-md">
<a href="/" class="hover:text-on-surface transition-colors">Home</a><span class="mx-2">/</span><span class="text-on-surface">Privacy Policy</span>
</nav>

<section class="py-space-lg max-w-[680px]">
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary">Legal</span>
<h1 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface mt-space-sm mb-space-md">Privacy Policy</h1>
<div class="article-body">
<p><em>Last updated: October 12, 2026</em></p>
<h2>What we collect</h2>
<p>My Sorted Nest is a simple reading website. We don't run accounts or comments, so we don't ask for your name, email, or any personal details. If you join the newsletter, we keep only your email address to send it — nothing else, and you can unsubscribe anytime.</p>
<h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
<p>We may use basic, privacy-friendly analytics to understand which articles readers find useful (for example, page views). This data is aggregated and never sold.</p>
<h2>Advertising</h2>
<p>In the future, this site may display ads from third-party ad networks. Those networks may use cookies to serve ads based on your visits to this and other sites. You can opt out of personalized advertising through your browser settings or at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/">aboutads.info/choices</a>.</p>
<h2>External links</h2>
<p>Articles may link to external retailers or resources. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of external sites.</p>
<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>If this policy changes, the updated version will be posted on this page with a new "last updated" date.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>For privacy questions, reach us via our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
</Layout>
